# LF everywhere, whatever the checkout's core.autocrlf: GitHub's Windows images set it to true, and
# CRLF breaks `git apply` of patches/*.patch against LF blobs (prepare-rune --check) and the exact
# text comparisons of golden trees and snapshots. (vendor/rune is a submodule that this file doesn't
# reach; CI turns core.autocrlf off before checking it out on Windows.)
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.node binary
*.metallib binary

# Upstream's font license texts, kept byte for byte (CRLF as published).
*-LICENSE.txt -text
